ob-bot source-study attribution

This MVP is an independently implemented composition inspired by these sources.
No source runtime packages from these projects are dependencies of ob-bot.

- Obsidian YOLO: lifecycle, views, persistence and transport concepts.
  Studied commit 975018f546602544b953f9a8f2bbd217e368a37b; MIT.
- DeepSeek dsh-superagent-prototype: ticket/assignment/attention and bounded
  orchestration concepts. Studied commit 8c32a9dc5d72c033816c6a8110b37f40cf94fba4;
  MIT.
- omdsh-dev/dsh-bot: bot identities, separate sessions, mention routing and
  bounded handoff ideas only. Studied commit
  61e6f8a49b718393551e6c97c41ba4ce1e2cc13b. No DSH runtime integration.

